    {
      "title": "US completes troop withdrawal from Iraq after 12 year anti-ISIS mission",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/world-news/us-completes-troop-withdrawal-from-iraq-after-12-year-anti-isis-mission-126093000570_1.html",
      "description": "The US military announced on Wednesday that it has completed the withdrawal of its troops from Iraq, ending a 12-year mission to fight the Islamic State group.\nPentagon spokesperson Sean Parnell said in a statement that U.S. troops and equipment had completed an \"orderly departure\" from the last air base where they had been present in northern Iraq.\n\"This milestone reflects the success of a 12-year campaign that defeated ISIS as an organized military threat in Iraq and across the region,\" he said. \"It also marks a transition from a wartime coalition mission to an Iraqi-led security effort supported by a more normal bilateral security relationship.",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-09-30T09:15:25"
